@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed shared-resource contention subjects
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Concurrent owned commands\nDraft publish / work mutation" as C
rectangle "Concurrent growth / replacement" as G
rectangle "Reference registration / cleanup" as F
rectangle "Conditional version / row guards" as V
rectangle "Quota / reservation guard" as Q
rectangle "Protected-reference / deletion exclusion" as R
database "Shared relational transactions" as DB
folder "Actual disk / artifacts / Git / temporary bytes" as DISK
rectangle "CPU / memory / process capacity" as CPU
C --> V
G --> Q
F --> R
V --> DB
Q --> DB
R --> DB
G --> DISK
F --> DISK
C ..> CPU
G ..> CPU
legend bottom
 Boxes name invariant/guard subjects, not selected engine locks or one global mutex.
 Bound transaction lifetime and evaluate consistent guard ordering; do not hold SQL locks across remote waits.
 Optimistic checks and native Git compare/update protect different state from resource admission.
endlegend
@enduml
